1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Meet Harbour. From broker preparation to authority review and payment evidence.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Start with the broker. See outstanding work and prepare the visit for review.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Give Customs the submitted information it needs to assess the visit.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Customs records each process outcome independently.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Captured passport information supports review. Immigration retains entry decisions.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Flag a passport that expires during the visit for officer review.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Review the assessment, amount and currency before the demo payment.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Simulate a successful payment without entering real card details.

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
A linked demo receipt returns to the visit, awaiting authority verification.

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Payment never grants clearance or automatically issues a permit.

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
After explicit issuance review, preserve the copy and its delivery history.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Explore the stakeholder demo: harbour-xi-eight.vercel.app
Working prototype. Fictional data. No live government integration.
